  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "Stable device fingerprint: the hardware identifier is now derived only from stable hardware (motherboard UUID, CPU, disk serial) and is persisted locally on first run. Volatile inputs (active MAC address set, OS version, machine name) are no longer mixed in, so the same physical device keeps one constant fingerprint across reboots, OS updates, VPNs, and Wi-Fi/Ethernet changes — preventing duplicate activation records for a single device. Previous (1.8.1): sessions auto-disconnect on application exit (ProcessExit / Ctrl+C).",
